---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import SecondryHero from "../components/SecondryHero.astro";
import BodyCopy from "../components/BodyCopy.astro";
---

<MainLayout
	title="Welcome to Hornsby Ku-ring-gai & Hills District Cricket Umpires Association."
>
	<SecondryHero
		title="Privacy Policy"
		subtitle="Our Privacy Policy"
		description="<p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'>Hornsby Kur-rin-gai & Hills District Umpires is committed to providing quality services to you and this policy outlines our ongoing obligations to you in respect of how we manage your Personal Information.</p><p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'>We have adopted the Australian Privacy Principles (APPs) contained in the Privacy Act 1988 (Cth) (the Privacy Act). The NPPs govern the way in which we collect, use, disclose, store, secure and dispose of your Personal Information.</p><p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'> A copy of the Australian Privacy Principles may be obtained from the website of The Office of the Australian Information Commissioner at www.oaic.gov.au</p>"
		image="./src/asset/images/privacy.jpg"
		link=""
		linkText=""
	/>
	<BodyCopy
		title="What is Personal Information and why do we collect it?"
		bodyCopy="<p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'>Personal Information is information or an opinion that identifies an individual. Examples of Personal Information we collect include: names, cricket ID, email addresses and possibly phone numbers.</p><p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'>This Personal Information is obtained in many ways including, correspondence, by telephone, by email, via forms on our HKHDCUA website and from third parties. We don’t guarantee website links or policy of authorised third parties.</p><p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'>We collect your Personal Information for the primary purpose of providing our services to you, providing information to our clients and marketing. We may also use your Personal Information for secondary purposes closely related to the primary purpose, in circumstances where you would reasonably expect such use or disclosure. You may unsubscribe from our mailing/marketing lists at any time by contacting us in writing.</p><p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'>When we collect Personal Information we will, where appropriate and where possible, explain to you why we are collecting the information and how we plan to use it.</p>"
		link=""
		linkText=""
	/>
	<BodyCopy
		title="Sensitive Information"
		bodyCopy="<p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'>Sensitive information is defined in the Privacy Act to include information or opinion about such things as an individual's racial or ethnic origin, political opinions, membership of a political association, religious or philosophical beliefs, membership of a trade union or other professional body, criminal record or health information.</p><h5 class='text-base font-bold text-gray-700 mt-4 mb-2'>Sensitive information will be used by us only:</h5><ul class='space-y-3'><li class='flex text-base text-gray-700'>For the primary purpose for which it was obtained – completion of and receipt of submitted results for umpires and captains tickets.</li><li class='flex text-base text-gray-700'>For a secondary purpose that is directly related to the primary purpose Cricket Membership ID to link to for exam results</li><li class='flex text-base text-gray-700'>With your consent; or where required or authorised by law.</li></ul>"
		link=""
		linkText=""
	/>
	<BodyCopy
		title="Third Parties"
		bodyCopy="<p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'>Where reasonable and practicable to do so, we will collect your Personal Information only from you. However, in some circumstances we may be provided with information by third parties. In such a case we will take reasonable steps to ensure that you are made aware of the information provided to us by the third party.</p>"
		link=""
		linkText=""
	/>
	<BodyCopy
		title="Disclosure of Personal Information"
		bodyCopy="<p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'>Your Personal Information may be disclosed in a number of circumstances including the following:</p><ul class='space-y-3'><li class='flex text-base text-gray-700'>For review and listing of successful completion of captains ticket, other relevant learning and expiration status</li><li class='flex text-base text-gray-700'>Third parties where you consent to the use or disclosure; and</li><li class='flex text-base text-gray-700'>Where required or authorised by law.</li></ul>"
		link=""
		linkText=""
	/>
	<BodyCopy
		title="Security of Personal Information"
		bodyCopy="<p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'>Your Personal Information is stored in a manner that reasonably protects it from misuse and loss and from unauthorized access, modification or disclosure.</p><p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'>When your Personal Information is no longer needed for the purpose for which it was obtained, we will take reasonable steps to destroy or permanently de-identify your Personal Information. However, most of the Personal Information is or will be stored in client files which will be kept by us for a minimum of 7 years.</p>"
		link=""
		linkText=""
	/>
	<BodyCopy
		title="Access to your Personal Information"
		bodyCopy="<p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'>You may access the Personal Information we hold about you and to update and/or correct it, subject to certain exceptions. If you wish to access your Personal Information, please contact us in writing.</p><p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'>Hornsby Ku-rin-gai & Hills District Umpires will not charge any fee for your access request, but may charge an administrative fee for providing a copy of your Personal Information.</p><p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'>In order to protect your Personal Information we may require identification from you before releasing the requested information.</p>"
		link=""
		linkText=""
	/>
	<BodyCopy
		title="Maintaining the Quality of your Personal Information"
		bodyCopy="<p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'>It is an important to us that your Personal Information is up to date. We will take reasonable steps to make sure that your Personal Information is accurate, complete and up-to-date. If you find that the information we have is not up to date or is inaccurate, please advise us as soon as practicable so we can update our records and ensure we can continue to provide quality services to you.</p>"
		link=""
		linkText=""
	/>
	<BodyCopy
		title="Policy Updates"
		bodyCopy="<p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'>This Policy may change from time to time and is available on our website.</p>"
		link=""
		linkText=""
	/>
	<BodyCopy
		title="Privacy Policy Complaints and Enquiries"
		bodyCopy="<p class='text-base text-gray-700 mb-2'>If you have any queries or complaints about our Privacy Policy please contact us. <a class='text-base inline-flex items-center transition-colors duration-200 text-gray-700 hover:text-blue-800' href='mailto:steve@newmail.com.au'>Please email the site contact (VP)</a></p>"
		link=""
		linkText=""
	/>
</MainLayout>
